:"Ahhh!! The fire! It's too strong! *Cough* *cough*... *cough*..."},{"t":"line","name":"Old Man","text":"You wretch!!! If I die here... Curse you!!! Curse you!!! My Emperor, I beseech you, lay down your divine punishment on these wretched Infected!!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Talulah","text":"......"},{"t":"line","name":"Talulah","text":"Ah... ah..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":2,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"image","a":{"fadetime":0}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"fadetime":3,"block":false}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"There is no turning back anymore."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Besides Talulah, no one else knows of the events that transpired here."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"And everything that occurred after that is as good as public knowledge."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"subtitle","a":{"text":"But should you recognize me, should you have understood me, should you realize just the sort of world you're stood in...","x":200,"y":360,"alignment":"left","size":24,"delay":0.04,"width":1280}},{"t":"cmd","c":"subtitle","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"subtitle","a":{"text":"Ursus's future will from then on be in your hands.","x":200,"y":360,"alignment":"left","size":24,"delay":0.04,"width":1280}},{"t":"cmd","c":"subtitle","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":3,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"image":"bg_top","screenadapt":"coverall"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"fadetime":3,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_walk_n"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#4","fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Amiya opens her eyes."},{"t":"line","name":null,"text":"Though her tears are welling up in her eyes, she has already seen it all."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_011_talula_1","fadetime":1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Talulah","text":"——"},{"t":"line","name":"Talulah","text":"What's a Cautus doing here?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_010_chen_1#2"}},{"t":"line","name":"Ch'en","text":"Amiya!! Watch out!!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"fadetime":3,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"image","a":{}}]}
